# The distroless runtime starts as root only so the static runtime-init helper
# can prepare bind-mounted paths. The helper accepts one fixed Node entrypoint,
# clears supplementary groups, then calls setgid/setuid before executing Node.
AVD-DS-0002
DS-0002

